# ============================================================
#  faa-analyzer — 展示仓库的提交护栏
#  这个仓库只允许出现：文档、截图、脱敏样本。
#  下面这些规则是硬保险：任何实现层面的东西都不许进版本库。
# ============================================================

# --- 源码（一律不进） ---
*.py
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.ipynb
*.js
*.mjs
*.ts
*.tsx
*.jsx
*.vue
*.sh
*.bat
*.ps1
Dockerfile
docker-compose*.yml
Makefile

# --- 模型与权重 ---
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.onnx
*.engine
*.trt
*.tflite
*.safetensors
*.bin
*.h5
*.pkl
*.joblib
weights/
models/
checkpoints/

# --- 数据与标注 ---
datasets/
*.csv
*.parquet
*.jsonl
*.npy
*.npz
*.db
*.sqlite*
pitch_annotation*/
annotations/

# --- 内部资料与工作卷宗 ---
docs/内部/
docs/internal/
qa/
evidence/
memory/
.trash_pending/
backup*/
*_source_v*.py

# --- 部署与凭据 ---
deploy.sh
site.zip
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
credentials*
secrets*
.cloudflare/

# --- 视频与大文件（GitHub 单文件 100M 硬限；视频走站点链接） ---
*.mp4
*.mov
*.avi
*.mkv
*.webm
*.zip
*.7z
*.tar
*.gz

# --- 系统杂物 ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
node_modules/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.log
